(a1b) before configuration (indicator rail off: its gate switch holds it off), controller as above: 0.229 A; with the controller at the lowest tabulated figure (71 mA) and U791 at rest: 0.133 A; the standard's one unit load is 0.100 A
(a2) VBUS minimum at the connector end 4.75 V (USB 2.0 7.2.2, functions above one unit load): drop 0.334 V in F401 at R1max; F401 output goes straight to pin 3 of JP301 (a header contact's few milliohms are under 1 mV at this current)
     +5V on cable power 4.416 V
     LT1963A-3.3 input must be at least 3.750 V (3.400 + 0.350, the dropout maximum at 500 mA over temperature; the 3.3 V load is 200 mA): margin 0.666 V -> in regulation: True
     fuse resistance at which the margin is gone: 2.99 ohm (R1max 1.00 ohm)
